<title>USA: Egypt buys 300,000 T US SRW wheat - US exporters.</title>
<headline>Egypt buys 300,000 T US SRW wheat - US exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt bought 300,000 tonnes of U.S. soft red winter wheat overnight for $127.00 per tonne, FOB U.S. Gulf, for August shipment, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
